[list]
[*][b]Sex sounds from the engine (new).[/b] Animation packs fire canned sounds from timings, unrelated to contact, and each pack is different. An engine hook mutes them in scenes (measured on 228 sound records of 9 packs), and our own loudness-matched set plays from each stroke's real depth and speed: 9 kinds, 37 clips. On by default. Lick, finger and handjob use stand-in clips until their own recordings.
