[*][b]Penis aim.[/b] Animations are made for other bodies, so the shaft goes through thighs and bellies. Here it locks onto the opening the animation meant (vagina, anus, mouth, a gripping hand) and bends joint by joint along the canal: it captures within 35° and 5 units, and keeps within 45° and 8.
[*][b]The mouth.[/b] The face is the game's undocumented animation data, reverse-engineered: the mouth opens to what is at the lips, and the lips are fitted round it from 15 measured morphs per sex.
[*][b]Glances (with Rapport).[/b] Eyes meet the partner's, 4-7 seconds now and then.
[*][b]Arousal.[/b] Rises from scenes, nudity, watching and a companion's own arousal, and fades with time; nipples follow.
[*][b]A shaped penis.[/b] A slightly thinner shaft and a bigger head on every man's bones at run time, and a redder glans with LooksMenu.
